.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/842780/extras/4d84f1c6cc5e62580f1d9d453566a7f2.poster.avif?t=1742220057\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/842780/extras/4d84f1c6cc5e62580f1d9d453566a7f2.webm?t=1742220057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/842780/extras/4d84f1c6cc5e62580f1d9d453566a7f2.mp4?t=1742220057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>-Lead your vessel to victory in Campaigns and Quick Battle Modes, through aggressive yet careful use of your powerful armaments like torpedoes and armor-piercing shells.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/842780/extras/de4ceadafc9caee991695c62ffe5d5d8.poster.avif?t=1742220057\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/842780/extras/de4ceadafc9caee991695c62ffe5d5d8.webm?t=1742220057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/842780/extras/de4ceadafc9caee991695c62ffe5d5d8.mp4?t=1742220057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>-Arm your ship with Anti-Air weapons, including Phalanx CIWS, try to survive in the test scene after several waves of air strikes!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/842780/extras/fcf70eacfc8760fdfade011fbfa60e27.poster.avif?t=1742220057\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/842780/extras/fcf70eacfc8760fdfade011fbfa60e27.webm?t=1742220057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/842780/extras/fcf70eacfc8760fdfade011fbfa60e27.mp4?t=1742220057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>-W